      "applicability": "moderate",
      "direction": "supportive",
      "decision_effect": "strengthened",
      "card_ids": ["C33","C34","C36","C39","C42"]
    },
    {
      "family": "oral_auc_cmax_exposure",
      "applicability": "low",
      "direction": "supportive",
      "decision_effect": "no_change",
      "card_ids": ["C43"]
    }
  ],
  "evidence_gaps": [
    "No direct oral bioavailability measurement for the query molecule is present in the supplied records.",
    "No query-matched formulation, dose, prandial state, or disease condition is available.",
    "Ester prodrug hydrolysis and first-pass metabolism of the benzoate ester are not directly quantified.",
    "L3 records are Cmax/AUC exposure values without IV comparators, so they cannot directly establish absolute F.",
    "Transferability of training-context records to the query is uncertain because the query has no reported external condition."
  ],
  "decision_summary": "Predicted high: favorable physicochemical prior plus uniformly positive L1 records (all ≥34% or qualitative good/complete) and L2 nitro/ester analog context; L3 oral exposure records for metronidazole and nitroimidazole analogs show substantial systemic exposure after oral dosing, supporting absorption. No affirmative threshold-relevant evidence supports F < 20%; confidence remains moderate because no direct query-specific F measurement is available and prodrug hydrolysis is not quantified."
}

